    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: d42adf948d6ff159cbc12b794c09f8c5c6340782 -->\n**Read-only delta re-check** (not rebuilt, no checkout). Last reviewed at c1fae0e9, now at d42adf94.\n\n**Verdict: Needs changes before merge.** Docs and process only; the change is correct. Two things to fix: the process number is below main's, and the branch conflicts in that file.\n\n**Delta since c1fae0e9**\n- Own non-merge commit: d42adf94, `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` 17 to 18 only.\n- Merge 39374d18 (main into the branch): clean, no hand-resolved hunk.\n\n**Own diff** (`git diff origin/main...d42adf94`): `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` and `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md` (+2 lines: `get_tool_cutter_profile` and `set_tool_cutter_profile` rows, placed after `set_tool`). No snapshot PNG, no workflow file.\n\n**SKILL.md rows** (checked against main's current file, 9032da34)\n- The branch predates main's three rows (`set_raw_stock_only`, `list_holder_library`, `set_tool_holder`), so the head file does not show them. A trial merge with current main keeps all three rows and both new rows, in one file, with the cutter rows after `set_tool_holder`. Nothing is dropped on merge; merging main will make the branch's view match.\n\n**Process version**\n- Head: 18. Main: 20 (9032da34). Below main, so this is a requested change: take the next free number above main (21 at this moment).\n\n**Mergeable**: CONFLICTING. The trial merge against 9032da34 conflicts in `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` only.\n\n**Requested before merge**\n1. Merge main and set `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` above main's 20 (21 at this moment).\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
